{"id":50761,"date":"2026-04-23T22:19:04","date_gmt":"2026-04-23T21:19:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50761"},"modified":"2026-09-02T20:32:03","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T19:32:03","slug":"50-milhas-no-reino-da-pedra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/50-milhas-no-reino-da-pedra\/","title":{"rendered":"50 Milhas \u2013 No Reino da Pedra 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">50 Milhas \u2013 No Reino da Pedra 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A m\u00edtica prova <strong>50 Milhas \u2013 No Reino da Pedra 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>19 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na imponente freguesia de <strong>Alqueid\u00e3o da Serra<\/strong>, no concelho de Porto de M\u00f3s, em pleno cora\u00e7\u00e3o do Parque Natural das Serras de Aire e Candeeiros. Organizada pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o PMC<\/strong> com o apoio da Junta de Freguesia e do CCR Alqueid\u00e3o da Serra, a prova \u00e9 uma das aventuras mais \u00e9picas, duras e carism\u00e1ticas do maci\u00e7o calc\u00e1rio estremenho.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e meta na <strong>sede da CCR Alqueid\u00e3o da Serra<\/strong>, os percursos desafiam o lend\u00e1rio terreno pedregoso, dolinas e lapi\u00e1s que d\u00e3o o nome ao Reino da Pedra. O programa conta com a ultra dist\u00e2ncia de <strong>50 Milhas (~80 km)<\/strong> (07h30), o <strong>Trail Sprint de 12 km<\/strong> (17h00) e a <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> (17h05). A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica Recorde Pessoal, medalha finisher met\u00e1lica, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, refei\u00e7\u00e3o final com conv\u00edvio e balne\u00e1rios com duches quentes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-wi